  "prefLabel": "Spe 404.03 Procedure for Imposition of Sanctions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Spe 404.03 Procedure for Imposition of Sanctions. Other than the immediate suspension of a license authorized by RSA 541-A:30, III, the board shall impose disciplinary sanctions only:\n\n(a) After prior notice to the licensee or certificate holder in accordance with Ahp 209.01 and the opportunity for the licensee or the certificate holder to be heard; or\n\n(b) By agreement in a settlement between the board and the licensee or certificate holder made pursuant to Ahp 214.\n\nSource. #9385, eff 2-7-09; ss by #11178, eff 9-17-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/spe100-600.html"
}
